ximally supersymmetric plane-wave background. We observe a cascade of instabilities that originates from the dipole (<math display=\"inline\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>) and quadrupole (<math display=\"inline\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>) sectors (the only unstable sectors of the LO) and propagates toward all the multipoles of the NLO.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"APS"}},{"source":"arXiv","value":"We study the leading (LO) and the next-to-leading order (NLO) stability of multipole perturbations for a static dielectric M2-brane with spherical topology in the 11-dimensional maximally supersymmetric plane-wave background. We observe a cascade of instabilities that originates from the dipole (j=1) and quadrupole (j=2) sectors (the only unstable sectors of the LO) and propagates towards all the multipoles of the NLO.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"arXiv"}}],"control_number":1915791,"dois":[{"material":"publication","source":"APS","value":"10.1103/PhysRevD.104.106002"},{"material":"publication","source":"arXiv","value":"10.1103/PhysRevD.104.106002"}],"preprint_date":"2021-09-02","arxiv_eprints":[{"categories":["hep-th"],"value":"2109.01088"}],"titles":[{"source":"APS","title":"Cascade of instabilities in the classical limit of the Berenstein-Maldacena-Nastase matrix model"},{"source":"arXiv","title":"Cascade of instabilities in the classical limit of the BMN matrix model"}],"document_type":["article"]},"id":"1915791","created":"2021-09-03T04:11:32.145239+00:00"}],"total":1},"links":{"self":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.01088&size=5&page=1&fields=titles,authors,dois,publication_info,arxiv_eprints,document_type,preprint_date,imprints,abstracts,urls","bibtex":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.01088&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex","latex-eu":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.01088&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu","latex-us":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.0